\begin_layout Standard

\lang brazilian
Falha Identificada no Gradiente
\end_layout

\end_inset

No cálculo da derivada parcial em src/calculo.c, o teste esperava 2.0 para a função f(x,y)=x²+y² no ponto (1,1), mas recebeu -2.0 (sinal invertido). 
\end_layout

\end_deeper
\begin_layout Frame

\lang brazilian
Causa Raiz e Correção em src/calculo.c: 
\end_layout

\begin_deeper
\begin_layout AlertBlock

\lang brazilian

\begin_inset Argument 2
status collapsed


\begin_layout Standard

\lang brazilian
Incorreto (Ordem Invertida)
\end_layout

\end_inset


\family typewriter
return (l_inferior - l_superior) / (2.0 * h);
\family default
 
\end_layout

\end_deeper
\begin_deeper
\begin_layout ExampleBlock

\lang brazilian

\begin_inset Argument 2
status collapsed


\begin_layout Standard

\lang brazilian
Corrigido (Ordem Correta: f(x+h) - f(x-h))
\end_layout

\end_inset


\family typewriter
return (l_superior - l_inferior) / (2.0 * h);
\family default
 
\end_layout

\end_deeper
